WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.554
The PIN is changed in Settings, not in the panel.

2
00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:26.765
Tap the gear, at the top right of the kiosk.

3
00:00:26.765 --> 00:00:31.924
Settings opens with Face ID, never the PIN.

4
00:00:31.924 --> 00:00:38.307
That is deliberate: a forgotten PIN can still be replaced here.

5
00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:43.804
Tap Change PIN.

6
00:00:43.804 --> 00:00:50.138
Type the PIN you use now.

7
00:00:50.138 --> 00:00:55.944
Then the new one.

8
00:00:55.944 --> 00:01:02.097
And again, to be sure.

9
00:01:02.097 --> 00:01:11.533
Tap Save. The new PIN works straight away.
